{"seq":2,"slug":"authorization-access-control","title":"授权与访问控制：网关如何决定\"能做什么\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authorization-access-control","wordCount":763,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"授权与访问控制-网关如何决定-能做什么\">授权与访问控制：网关如何决定&quot;能做什么&quot;</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>RBAC（基于角色）</strong></td>\n<td>权限绑定到角色，用户通过角色获得权限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>ABAC（基于属性）</strong></td>\n<td>权限由主体属性 + 资源属性 + 环境属性共同决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Scope（OAuth 范围）</strong></td>\n<td>OAuth 2.0 中定义 Token 能访问的操作集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>OPA（Open Policy Agent）</strong></td>\n<td>云原生策略引擎，将授权策略与业务代码解耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Policy as Code</strong></td>\n<td>将访问控制策略写成版本化的代码，可测试可审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"认证之后-授权的问题\">认证之后：授权的问题</h2><p>认证只解决了&quot;这个调用方是谁&quot;，授权解决&quot;这个调用方能不能做这件事&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"认证通过：用户 ID = user123，角色 = editor&#10;授权问题：&#10;  - 能否 GET /api/v1/articles/456？          → 是（editor 可读）&#10;  - 能否 DELETE /api/v1/articles/456？       → 是（editor 可删自己的文章）&#10;  - 能否 DELETE /api/v1/users/789？          → 否（没有 admin 权限）&#10;  - 能否在 22:00-06:00 访问管理接口？        → 否（时间范围限制）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>认证通过：用户 ID = user123，角色 = editor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>授权问题：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 能否 GET /api/v1/articles/456？          → 是（editor 可读）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 能否 DELETE /api/v1/articles/456？       → 是（editor 可删自己的文章）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 能否 DELETE /api/v1/users/789？          → 否（没有 admin 权限）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - 能否在 22:00-06:00 访问管理接口？        → 否（时间范围限制）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>授权策略的复杂度远高于认证，且随业务演进频繁变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于-oauth-scope-的粗粒度授权\">基于 OAuth Scope 的粗粒度授权</h2><p>OAuth 2.0 的 Scope 机制提供了一种简单的授权模型，适合 API 平台场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Token Payload:&#10;{&#10;  &quot;sub&quot;: &quot;user123&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;articles:read articles:write profile:read&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Token Payload:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"sub\": \"user123\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"scope\": \"articles:read articles:write profile:read\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>网关按 Route 配置所需 Scope，请求 Token 的 Scope 必须包含该 Route 要求的所有 Scope：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"routes:&#10;  - path: GET /api/v1/articles&#10;    required_scopes: [&#39;articles:read&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - path: POST /api/v1/articles&#10;    required_scopes: [&#39;articles:write&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - path: DELETE /api/v1/users/:id&#10;    required_scopes: [&#39;users:admin&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">routes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GET /api/v1/articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    required_scopes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'articles:read'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POST /api/v1/articles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    required_scopes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'articles:write'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DELETE /api/v1/users/:id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    required_scopes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'users:admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Scope 检查简单高效，适合&quot;能否调用这个 API&quot;的粗粒度判断。但对于&quot;能否操作这个具体资源&quot;（如只能删除自己的文章），网关层面难以判断，需要下推到服务层处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基于-rbac-的路由级授权\">基于 RBAC 的路由级授权</h2><p>RBAC 将权限绑定到角色，网关做路由级别的角色检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 网关授权配置&#10;authorization_policies:&#10;  - route: &#39;DELETE /api/v1/articles/:id&#39;&#10;    allowed_roles: [&#39;admin&#39;, &#39;editor&#39;]&#10;&#10;  - route: &#39;GET /api/v1/admin/*&#39;&#10;    allowed_roles: [&#39;admin&#39;]&#10;    ip_whitelist: [&#39;10.0.0.0/8&#39;] # 同时要求内网 IP&#10;&#10;  - route: &#39;GET /api/v1/articles&#39;&#10;    allowed_roles: [&#39;admin&#39;, &#39;editor&#39;, &#39;viewer&#39;] # 所有角色可读\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 网关授权配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">authorization_policies</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DELETE /api/v1/articles/:id'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    allowed_roles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'editor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET /api/v1/admin/*'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    allowed_roles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ip_whitelist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'10.0.0.0/8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同时要求内网 IP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'GET /api/v1/articles'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    allowed_roles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'editor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'viewer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 所有角色可读</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实现示例\">实现示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type AuthorizationMiddleware struct {&#10;    policies map[string]Policy // route pattern → Policy&#10;}&#10;&#10;type Policy struct {&#10;    AllowedRoles []string&#10;    IPWhitelist  []net.IPNet&#10;    TimeWindows  []TimeWindow&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (m *AuthorizationMiddleware) Authorize(ctx *RequestContext) error {&#10;    policy, found := m.matchPolicy(ctx.Path, ctx.Method)&#10;    if !found {&#10;        return nil // 无策略 = 允许（或 deny all，取决于默认行为）&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 检查角色&#10;    if !policy.hasRole(ctx.UserRoles) {&#10;        return ErrForbidden(&quot;角色不足: 需要 %v，当前 %v&quot;, policy.AllowedRoles, ctx.UserRoles)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 检查 IP（可选）&#10;    if len(policy.IPWhitelist) &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; !policy.inIPWhitelist(ctx.ClientIP) {&#10;        return ErrForbidden(&quot;IP 不在白名单: %s&quot;, ctx.ClientIP)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AuthorizationMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    policies </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Policy</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // route pattern → Policy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Policy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    AllowedRoles []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    IPWhitelist  []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IPNet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    TimeWindows  []</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TimeWindow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">m </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">AuthorizationMiddleware</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Authorize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">RequestContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    policy, found </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> m.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">matchPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.Path, ctx.Method)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">found {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 无策略 = 允许（或 deny all，取决于默认行为）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查角色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">policy.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hasRole</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.UserRoles) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ErrForbidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"角色不足: 需要 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">，当前 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%v</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, policy.AllowedRoles, ctx.UserRoles)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 检查 IP（可选）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(policy.IPWhitelist) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">policy.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">inIPWhitelist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx.ClientIP) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ErrForbidden</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"IP 不在白名单: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ctx.ClientIP)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"opa-open-policy-agent-集成\">OPA（Open Policy Agent）集成</h2><p>当授权策略变得复杂（跨多个维度、需要频繁更新）时，OPA 提供了更强大的解决方案。</p>\n<p>OPA 将策略从应用代码中抽离，用 Rego 语言编写策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# policy.rego&#10;package api.gateway&#10;&#10;default allow = false&#10;&#10;# 管理员可以访问所有接口&#10;allow {&#10;    input.user.roles[_] == &quot;admin&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;# Editor 只能访问文章相关接口&#10;allow {&#10;    input.user.roles[_] == &quot;editor&quot;&#10;    startswith(input.request.path, &quot;/api/v1/articles&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 工作时间限制（非工作时间只允许读操作）&#10;allow {&#10;    input.request.method == &quot;GET&quot;&#10;    hour := time.clock(time.now_ns())[0]&#10;    hour &lt; 8&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># policy.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package api.gateway</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>default allow = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 管理员可以访问所有接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.user.roles[_] == \"admin\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># Editor 只能访问文章相关接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.user.roles[_] == \"editor\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startswith(input.request.path, \"/api/v1/articles\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 工作时间限制（非工作时间只允许读操作）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    input.request.method == \"GET\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hour := time.clock(time.now_ns())[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    hour &#x3C; 8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>网关在每次请求时调用 OPA 决策点（可以是进程内嵌入或 sidecar）：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant GW as API Gateway&#10;    participant OPA as OPA Agent&#10;&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;OPA: POST /v1/data/api/gateway {input: {user, request, resource}}&#10;    OPA--&gt;&gt;GW: {result: true}&#10;    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 放行请求\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant GW as API Gateway\n    participant OPA as OPA Agent\n\n    GW-&gt;&gt;OPA: POST /v1/data/api/gateway {input: {user, request, resource}}\n    OPA--&gt;&gt;GW: {result: true}\n    GW-&gt;&gt;GW: 放行请求</pre><p>OPA 的优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>策略可版本控制（存在 Git 中）、可单元测试</li>\n<li>支持复杂规则（时间窗口、IP 段、资源属性）</li>\n<li>策略更新无需重启网关（通过 OPA Bundle 热更新）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"细粒度授权的边界\">细粒度授权的边界</h2><p>网关适合做<strong>粗粒度授权</strong>（路由级别）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>授权问题</th>\n<th>处理位置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>路由级</td>\n<td>能否调用 POST /orders？</td>\n<td>网关（RBAC/Scope）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源级</td>\n<td>能否修改订单 456？（是否是自己的订单）</td>\n<td>业务服务层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段级</td>\n<td>响应中的 salary 字段是否返回？</td>\n<td>业务服务层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据行级</td>\n<td>只能看到自己团队的数据</td>\n<td>数据访问层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>网关做路由级授权，业务服务做资源级授权，两者分工明确。不要试图在网关实现所有层级的授权，这会导致业务逻辑渗入基础设施。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>网关层授权从简单到复杂有三个层次：OAuth Scope（粗粒度，速度最快）→ RBAC 路由策略（中粒度，可配置）→ OPA 策略引擎（细粒度复杂规则，Policy as Code）。关键原则是合理分层：网关做路由级别的访问门控，资源级别的权限检查（&quot;能否操作这个具体数据&quot;）留给业务服务。TLS 层面的安全见下一篇<a href=\"tls-certificate-management\">TLS 终止与证书管理</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"授权与访问控制：网关如何决定\"能做什么\"","id":"授权与访问控制-网关如何决定-能做什么"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"认证之后：授权的问题","id":"认证之后-授权的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"基于 OAuth Scope 的粗粒度授权","id":"基于-oauth-scope-的粗粒度授权"},{"level":2,"text":"基于 RBAC 的路由级授权","id":"基于-rbac-的路由级授权"},{"level":3,"text":"实现示例","id":"实现示例"},{"level":2,"text":"OPA（Open Policy Agent）集成","id":"opa-open-policy-agent-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"细粒度授权的边界","id":"细粒度授权的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网关层认证机制：集中化身份验证的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/authentication-at-gateway"},"next":{"title":"TLS 终止与证书管理：网关的 HTTPS 安全基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-patterns/security/tls-certificate-management"}}